  text: '<p class="fr"><span class="m nw"><i>x</i></span> est un réel tel que <span class="m nw">3 &lt; <i>x</i> &lt; 5</span>. Déterminer un encadrement de\u00a0: a. <span class="m nw"><i>x</i> + 3</span> b. <span class="m nw">−2<i>x</i></span> c. <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>x</i></span><span>4</span></span></span> d. <span class="m nw">3<i>x</i> − 2</span>.</p>\n<p class="it"><span class="m nw"><i>x</i></span> è un numero reale tale che <span class="m nw">3 &lt; <i>x</i> &lt; 5</span>. Determina tra quali valori sono compresi: a. <span class="m nw"><i>x</i> + 3</span> b. <span class="m nw">−2<i>x</i></span> c. <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>x</i></span><span>4</span></span></span> d. <span class="m nw">3<i>x</i> − 2</span>.</p>',
