EXOS.push({
  ch: 'c3', id: 'c3e211', group: 'eval', num: '211', page: 111,
  title: { fr: 'Trois formes, trois questions', it: 'Tre forme, tre domande' },
  text: '<p class="fr"><span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>A</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> <span class="mc">= (7<i>x</i> − 1)<sup>2</sup> − 4</span></span>. 1. a. Développer. b. Factoriser. 2. a. Calculer <span class="m nw"><i>A</i>(0)</span>. b. Résoudre <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>A</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> <span class="mc">= 0</span></span>. c. Résoudre <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>A</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> <span class="mc">= −4</span></span>.</p>\n<p class="it"><span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>A</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> <span class="mc">= (7<i>x</i> − 1)<sup>2</sup> − 4</span></span>. 1. a. Sviluppa. b. Scomponi. 2. a. Calcola <span class="m nw"><i>A</i>(0)</span>. b. Risolvi <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>A</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> <span class="mc">= 0</span></span>. c. Risolvi <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>A</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> <span class="mc">= −4</span></span>.</p>',
  parts: [
    { kind: 'self',
      sol: '<div class="calc">\n<p>1. a. <span class="m"><span class="mc">49<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> − 14<i>x</i> + 1 − 4</span> <span class="mc">= 49<i>x</i><sup>2</sup> − 14<i>x</i> − 3</span></span></p>\n<p>b. <span class="m"><span class="mc">(7<i>x</i> − 1)<sup>2</sup> − 2<sup>2</sup></span> <span class="mc">= (7<i>x</i> − 1 − 2)(7<i>x</i> − 1 + 2)</span> <span class="mc">= (7<i>x</i> − 3)(7<i>x</i> + 1)</span></span></p>\n<p>2. a. <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>A</i>(0)</span> <span class="mc">= −3</span></span> <span class="why"><span class="fr">forme développée</span><span class="it inl">forma sviluppata</span></span></p>\n<p>b. <span class="m"><span class="mc">(7<i>x</i> − 3)(7<i>x</i> + 1)</span> <span class="mc">= 0</span></span>\u00a0: <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>S</i></span> <span class="mc">= {−<span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>7</span></span>\u00a0; <span class="frac"><span>3</span><span>7</span></span>}</span></span> <span class="why"><span class="fr">forme factorisée</span><span class="it inl">forma scomposta</span></span></p>\n<p>c. <span class="m"><span class="mc">(7<i>x</i> − 1)<sup>2</sup> = 0</span> <span class="mc">⇔ <i>x</i> = <span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>7</span></span></span></span> <span class="why"><span class="fr">forme de l’énoncé</span><span class="it inl">forma del testo</span></span></p>\n</div>' }
  ]
});
EXOS.push({
  ch: 'c3', id: 'c3e212', group: 'eval', num: '212', page: 111,
  title: { fr: 'Inéquations', it: 'Disequazioni' },
  text: '<p class="items"><span class="item">1. <span class="m nw">5<i>x</i> − 1 ≤ 3<i>x</i> + 2</span></span> <span class="item">2. <span class="m nw"><i>x</i> + 3 &gt; 5<i>x</i> − 2(<i>x</i> + 1)</span></span></p>',
  parts: [
    { kind: 'self',
      sol: '<div class="calc">\n<p>1. <span class="m"><span class="mc">2<i>x</i> ≤ 3</span> <span class="mc">⇔ <i>x</i> ≤ <span class="frac"><span>3</span><span>2</span></span></span></span>\u00a0: <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>S</i></span> <span class="mc">= ]−∞\u00a0; <span class="frac"><span>3</span><span>2</span></span>]</span></span></p>\n<p>2. <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>x</i> + 3 &gt; 3<i>x</i> − 2</span> <span class="mc">⇔ 5 &gt; 2<i>x</i></span> <span class="mc">⇔ <i>x</i> &lt; <span class="frac"><span>5</span><span>2</span></span></span></span>\u00a0: <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>S</i></span> <span class="mc">= ]−∞\u00a0; <span class="frac"><span>5</span><span>2</span></span>[</span></span></p>\n</div>' }
  ]
});
EXOS.push({
  ch: 'c3', id: 'c3e214', group: 'eval', num: '214', page: 111,
  title: { fr: 'Deux triangles dans un rectangle', it: 'Due triangoli in un rettangolo' },
  text: '<p class="fr">ABCD est un rectangle avec AB = 6\u00a0cm et AD = 4\u00a0cm. M est sur [BC] et N sur [CD] avec BM = CN = <span class="m nw"><i>x</i></span>. <span class="m nw"><i>f</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> est l’aire du triangle ABM et <span class="m nw"><i>g</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> celle du triangle ADN. 1. À quel intervalle appartient <span class="m nw"><i>x</i></span>\u00a0? 2. Exprimer <span class="m nw"><i>f</i>(<i>x</i>)</span>. 3. Montrer que <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>g</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> <span class="mc">= −2<i>x</i> + 12</span></span>. 4. Pour quelles positions de M l’aire de ABM est-elle inférieure ou égale à celle de ADN\u00a0?</p>\n<p class="it">ABCD è un rettangolo con AB = 6\u00a0cm e AD = 4\u00a0cm. M è su [BC] e N su [CD] con BM = CN = <span class="m nw"><i>x</i></span>. <span class="m nw"><i>f</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> è l’area del triangolo ABM e <span class="m nw"><i>g</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> quella del triangolo ADN. 1. A quale intervallo appartiene <span class="m nw"><i>x</i></span>? 2. Esprimi <span class="m nw"><i>f</i>(<i>x</i>)</span>. 3. Dimostra che <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>g</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> <span class="mc">= −2<i>x</i> + 12</span></span>. 4. Per quali posizioni di M l’area di ABM è minore o uguale a quella di ADN?</p>',
  parts: [
    { kind: 'self',
      sol: '<div class="calc">\n<p>1. <span class="m nw"><i>x</i> ∈ [0\u00a0; 4]</span> <span class="why"><span class="fr">M est sur [BC], qui mesure 4\u00a0cm</span><span class="it inl">M è su [BC], che misura 4\u00a0cm</span></span></p>\n<p>2. <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>f</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span><i>AB</i> × <i>BM</i></span><span>2</span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span>6<i>x</i></span><span>2</span></span></span> <span class="mc">= 3<i>x</i></span></span></p>\n<p>3. <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>DN</i></span> <span class="mc">= 6 − <i>x</i></span></span>, <span class="fr">donc</span><span class="it inl">quindi</span> <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>g</i>(<i>x</i>)</span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span><i>AD</i> × <i>DN</i></span><span>2</span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span>4(6 − <i>x</i>)</span><span>2</span></span></span> <span class="mc">= −2<i>x</i> + 12</span></span></p>\n<p>4. <span class="m"><span class="mc">3<i>x</i> ≤ −2<i>x</i> + 12</span> <span class="mc">⇔ 5<i>x</i> ≤ 12</span> <span class="mc">⇔ <i>x</i> ≤ 2,4</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p class="fr">L’aire de ABM est inférieure ou égale à celle de ADN quand BM est entre 0 et 2,4\u00a0cm.</p>\n<p class="it">L’area di ABM è minore o uguale a quella di ADN quando BM è compreso tra 0 e 2,4\u00a0cm.</p>' }
  ]
});
EXOS.push({
  ch: 'c3', id: 'c3e226', group: 'eval', num: '226', page: 113,
  title: { fr: 'Divisible par 3', it: 'Divisibile per 3' },
  text: '<p class="fr">Montrer que, pour tout entier naturel <span class="m nw"><i>n</i></span>, le nombre <span class="m nw">4<sup><i>n</i>+1</sup> − 4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span> est divisible par 3.</p>\n<p class="it">Dimostra che, per ogni numero naturale <span class="m nw"><i>n</i></span>, il numero <span class="m nw">4<sup><i>n</i>+1</sup> − 4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span> è divisibile per 3.</p>',
  parts: [
    { kind: 'self',
      hint: '<p class="fr">Factorise par <span class="m nw">4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span>.</p>\n<p class="it">Raccogli <span class="m nw">4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span>.</p>',
      sol: '<div class="calc"><p><span class="m"><span class="mc">4<sup><i>n</i>+1</sup> − 4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span> <span class="mc">= 4<sup><i>n</i></sup> × 4 − 4<sup><i>n</i></sup> × 1</span> <span class="mc">= 4<sup><i>n</i></sup>(4 − 1)</span> <span class="mc">= 3 × 4<sup><i>n</i></sup></span></span></p></div>\n<p class="fr">C’est 3 fois un entier\u00a0: le nombre est divisible par 3. Un exemple (<span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>n</i></span> <span class="mc">= 1</span></span>\u00a0: <span class="m"><span class="mc">16 − 4</span> <span class="mc">= 12</span></span>) ne suffirait pas, il faut ce calcul valable pour tout <span class="m nw"><i>n</i></span>.</p>\n<p class="it">È 3 volte un intero: il numero è divisibile per 3. Un esempio (<span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>n</i></span> <span class="mc">= 1</span></span>: <span class="m"><span class="mc">16 − 4</span> <span class="mc">= 12</span></span>) non basterebbe, serve questo calcolo valido per ogni <span class="m nw"><i>n</i></span>.</p>' }
  ]
});
EXOS.push({
  ch: 'c3', id: 'c3e227', group: 'eval', num: '227', page: 113,
  title: { fr: 'Une drôle de fraction', it: 'Una strana frazione' },
  text: '<p class="fr"><span class="m nw"><i>a</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>b</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>c</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>d</i></span> sont des réels tels que <span class="m"><span class="mc"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span><i>c</i></span><span><i>d</i></span></span></span></span>, avec <span class="m nw"><i>b</i></span> et <span class="m nw"><i>d</i></span> non nuls et <span class="m nw"><i>b</i> + <i>d</i> ≠ 0</span>. La fraction <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span></span> est-elle égale à <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i> + <i>c</i></span><span><i>b</i> + <i>d</i></span></span></span>\u00a0?</p>\n<p class="it"><span class="m nw"><i>a</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>b</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>c</i></span>, <span class="m nw"><i>d</i></span> sono numeri reali tali che <span class="m"><span class="mc"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span><i>c</i></span><span><i>d</i></span></span></span></span>, con <span class="m nw"><i>b</i></span> e <span class="m nw"><i>d</i></span> non nulli e <span class="m nw"><i>b</i> + <i>d</i> ≠ 0</span>. La frazione <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span></span> è uguale a <span class="m nw"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i> + <i>c</i></span><span><i>b</i> + <i>d</i></span></span></span>?</p>',
  parts: [
    { kind: 'self',
      hint: '<p class="fr">Appelle <span class="m nw"><i>k</i></span> la valeur commune\u00a0: <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>a</i></span> <span class="mc">= <i>kb</i></span></span> et <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>c</i></span> <span class="mc">= <i>kd</i></span></span>. Teste d’abord avec <span class="m"><span class="mc"><span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span>3</span><span>6</span></span></span></span>.</p>\n<p class="it">Chiama <span class="m nw"><i>k</i></span> il valore comune: <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>a</i></span> <span class="mc">= <i>kb</i></span></span> e <span class="m"><span class="mc"><i>c</i></span> <span class="mc">= <i>kd</i></span></span>. Prova prima con <span class="m"><span class="mc"><span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span>3</span><span>6</span></span></span></span>.</p>',
      sol: '<div class="calc"><p><span class="m"><span class="mc"><span class="frac"><span><i>a</i> + <i>c</i></span><span><i>b</i> + <i>d</i></span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span><i>kb</i> + <i>kd</i></span><span><i>b</i> + <i>d</i></span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span><i>k</i>(<i>b</i> + <i>d</i>)</span><span><i>b</i> + <i>d</i></span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <i>k</i></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span></span></span></p></div>\n<p class="fr">Oui, c’est toujours vrai (exemple\u00a0: <span class="m"><span class="mc"><span class="frac"><span>1 + 3</span><span>2 + 6</span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span>4</span><span>8</span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></span></span>). Attention, cela ne veut pas dire qu’on additionne les fractions ainsi\u00a0: cela ne marche que parce que les deux fractions sont égales.</p>\n<p class="it">Sì, è sempre vero (esempio: <span class="m"><span class="mc"><span class="frac"><span>1 + 3</span><span>2 + 6</span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span>4</span><span>8</span></span></span> <span class="mc">= <span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></span></span>). Attenzione, non significa che le frazioni si sommano così: funziona solo perché le due frazioni sono uguali.</p>' }
  ]
});
